  "description": "Enterprise-grade, modular authentication library for ASP.NET Core 8.\n      Features: PostgreSQL/MSSQL provider abstraction, dynamic RBAC, SuperAdmin ENV seeder,\n      audit logging, JWT hardening with refresh rotation, emergency access system,\n      multi-identifier login (email/phone/username), soft delete, 2FA, Admin API endpoints,\n      hierarchical configuration (Auth:Jwt:SecretKey or AUTH_JWT_SECRET).",
